    "filters_usage": "Filters are FULLY SUPPORTED at generation time — pass them in generate_zeropark_report; do NOT defer filtering to SQL. Format: filters=[{\"name\": \"<FILTER_NAME>\", \"values\": [\"v1\", \"v2\"]}]. Names must come from this schema's filters lists. PUBLISHER_FEED takes publisher_feed_hash values (e.g. 'ibis-leopard'), NOT display names. Filters listed under filters.required accept exactly one value.",
