      "allowed": [
        "none",
        "BY_HOUR",
        "BY_DAY",
        "BY_MONTH"
      ],
      "default": "none",
      "note": "With 'BY_HOUR' or 'BY_DAY' and BY_MONTH a time column is ADDED AUTOMATICALLY to the report — do not put it in dimensions. These are the ONLY valid values; there is no week aggregation. Use BY_HOUR aggregation only if directly asked for; it is not a good idea for large reports"
    },
    "dates": "date_from/date_to use 'YYYY-MM-DD HH' (hour precision, UTC). date_to is an EXCLUSIVE end boundary (a point in time): to cover a full day X, end at the NEXT day's 00. Yesterday = '2026-08-02 00' -> '2026-08-03 00'; last 7 full days = '2026-07-27 00' -> '2026-08-03 00'. Ending at 'X 23' drops the 23:00-23:59 hour — never do that for whole-day ranges."
  },
